{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-01", "pageid": 56390, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-02\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8E.BB.E7.92.83.E7.93.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"玻璃瓶\">玻璃瓶</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 玻璃瓶</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“天上的声音如是说，有件大事将要发生在你身上。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高谈阔论者尚且稚嫩年轻，他像是一枝新生的葡萄藤，挺拔向上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“那人便开口问了，那是什么样的事？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“天上的声音回答，你将变得富足美满，拥有智慧与声名，迎娶美丽的妻子。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“于是，他终其一生地等待一个奇迹，直至死亡到来，一切仍未发生。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他手中持着记载文字的书卷，由广场的这一侧，步行向那一侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>天上的声音带来许诺，换而言之，那人窥见了自己将要来的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>那人便相信了，顺从，由此盲目，从而铸成了自己可悲的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是平缓的、安宁的呼吸声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37……37……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低声的呼唤难以叫醒沉睡的姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>踟蹰片刻，苏菲亚伸出手，轻而缓地晃动了两下身旁的37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……嗯……嗯？怎么了……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小姑娘揉着眼睛，将散乱的头发撩起，有些恍惚地四下查看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……210的演讲结束了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>还没有，只是你睡得太熟了，有些打鼾，我担心他们听见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>而且……在别人演讲的时候睡觉，好像也不太好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>尤其是210，他一向喜欢说话，也在乎人们是不是真的有在认真地听他说话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯……可是，难道耽误他人获取知识不是更不好的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>真理不该仰赖雄辩，也不该含混不清。我看不出这种华而不实的修辞里会有什么真正的知识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>啊哈，我已经在尽量减少他的罪孽了……至少他谈话的韵律很适合入睡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37小小地打了一个哈欠，靠在苏菲亚的身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可关于命运、道路、自我选择的辉煌一类的高谈阔论并没有绕过她们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37睁开眼睛，看见红发之下，苏菲亚认真向前注视的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你对这个话题很感兴趣吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……我也不太清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但人总会在乎自己的命运，在乎明天会发生什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我还没有自己的数字，还未了解自己的本质，更不清楚自己的命运……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚的视线下垂，看着自己放在膝盖上并拢的双手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>他说的事情有道理，努力地向前走未尝不是一件好事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但是，我还未找到属于我的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我刚到达这里不久，我要学习的事情还有许多……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻姑娘的声音渐渐地、渐渐地弱下去，沉闷下去，最终到达了一处低谷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着，她吸了一口气，像是重新振奋了精神，抬起眼睛望向身旁的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你呢？37，你不好奇你的命运……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼吸平稳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-510912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>○……不是最大的素数……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显而易见，年轻孩子需要睡眠，尤其擅长酣然入睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>友人的激昂论调对她来说如此乏味，以至于难以维持片刻清醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“那人缠绵病榻时，又对天上的声音询问，那件大事在何时发生？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“天上的声音回答他：一切早已发生，只是你未参与其中。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>“于是那人悔恨，悔恨自己的胆怯，悔恨自己错失的命运。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>所以我们应该警醒，我们要保持目光的清明，倾听自己的声音，而非怠惰地停滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>如若恐惧、胆怯、故步自封，即使是命运中所注定的馈赠，也会轻易流逝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>而人的变革与新知，来源于勇气、求知的探索欲与源源不断的好奇之心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>正是因此，我们才得以开拓道路，掌握自己的命运——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高举起手，未来修辞学家的模样已初现端倪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一片，两片，慷慨陈词之下，少年人面前支持的海贝已堆起一座小丘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他对此满意，却不够满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>命运——是的，我们既然探讨命运，就不能回避我们之中坐着的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>正如我们的赫尔墨斯之星，她出生便降落在命运之上，带来了启明的希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我们可以让她来发表一番言论，因为她的光芒不曾消减，只是现在，睡梦拖住了她，让她无法闪耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210调转方向，突兀地指向另一侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>但还好，我们之中仍有人足以代表命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他伸出手，掌心向上，指尖向前，做出邀请的姿态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群如受惊的游鱼一般散开几米，露出了淹没在其中的少年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>来吧，亚齐，我的朋友——将受“启示”之人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你注定成为最完满的数字，将获得一切的智慧以及所有当有的应许——我们阿派朗未来的领导者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>不要让沉默吞没那些光。请阐述那些有关命运的观点，请与我们分享你的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被赋予颇长头衔的男孩在人群中并不突出。他的目光在邀请的手掌之上滑过，停留在它旁边的一处空气上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这并非我的演讲，210。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>可没有人比你更了解命运，你每时每刻都浸泡在完美的“6”之中等待着它的到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的雄辩者等待着——是的，对方理应有着可以与自己媲美的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可以预见，这应是一场令人喜悦的、势均力敌的酣畅辩论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周围的目光显然令这位惯于隐没在人群中的少年感到不适，他甚至微微侧身，试图以动作辅助自己表达抗拒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>唔，亚齐看起来不太高兴……210说的“启示”是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>没什么大不了的，只是一个故弄玄虚的词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>在每一任学派领袖的灵魂数字出现时，他们会得到某个不传的“指示”。这是他们继任的征兆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>就像是人们以前在德尔斐的神庙里聆听阿波罗的神谕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧闹让女孩儿睡得并不踏实，也或许是她对那样张扬似孔雀的演讲者有所不满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这，这听起来很了不起。你是说他们能听到神的声音么……？还是数字之类的……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>初来岛上不久的红发女孩发出惊叹的低呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的同伴对此却不以为意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可每一任学派领袖的数字都是6，所以这指示没有什么新奇的——我们早就知道结果了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>210用了太多无意义的修辞。何不直接称他为6呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你是说亚齐？可6……6不是那位……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>噢，是的，他还没有接受“启示”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但他早晚都会是6的，因为这是他的本质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>——我没有任何看法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩的声音变得高了些，打断了远处的窃窃私语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>怎么会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你是数字6，我们都知道。你将成为数字6，拥有一个6应当拥有的一切——无穷的智慧、无上的视界、敏锐的思维与领导者的气魄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>因为你继承了预言中的血脉，“启示”自你降生时已注定，甚至比天上的声音更加明晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>瞧瞧吧——你与故事中的人何其相似。你们都听到了预言，也都已知晓了自身的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你从中得到了什么，又听到了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一场冲锋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>由骄傲的、羽翼渐丰的雄鸟向这座岛上预备的领导者发起的诘问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你并未投掷你的海贝，我想知道其中的原因，也想了解与我不同的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>朋友，思想在辩论中交锋，我们能从中相互获得更多，我希望你能够分享——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“当啷。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话头被清脆的声响打断。他低下头，看见高耸的海贝顶端迎来了新的加入者——对方将他的“战书”同这枚海贝一起轻轻抛掷在他的脚尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——210读不出这枚海贝除“羞辱”以外的其他含义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>你理解错了。对于命运，我没有想法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐终于应向对方的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我对此也无话可说。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-01"}}